#   sphere      cx cy cz  radius  H
# DFG 2D-1 cylinder: center (0.2, 0.2), D = 0.1, in the z-slab [0, 0.05].
1
cylinder_z  0.2 0.2 0.0   0.05  0.05   0.0 0.05
